Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:51.04,general text,,0,0,0,,The room will be empty while the gentleman is in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:53.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Clean up here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:55.13,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:01:02.01,general text,,0,0,0,,He left the house and returned many times
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.59,0:01:05.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait a couple of days, maybe he’ll come back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.89,0:01:07.14,general text,,0,0,0,,This time everything is different
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.89,0:01:10.85,general text,,0,0,0,,He has changed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:14.35,general text,,0,0,0,,And maybe he’ll get married soon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:16.61,italics,,0,0,0,,So we need to clean up everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:19.44,italics,,0,0,0,,Is he engaged again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.36,0:01:23.70,general text,,0,0,0,,If he doesn’t get married this time, he’s unlikely to get a wife
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:25.86,italics,,0,0,0,,This time everything is different!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:30.83,general text,,0,0,0,,The young master is deeply in love with someone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.37,0:01:33.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Really, Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:37.75,general text,,0,0,0,,The bird's egg he mentioned
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:42.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure this is the girl I saw in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.59,0:01:46.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Egg in a nest on the top of a tree
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.89,general text,,0,0,0,,This is probably a sophisticated girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:51.27,general text,,0,0,0,,which needs to be protected
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:54.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Something like a white heron
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:55.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Like me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.27,0:01:56.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.31,0:02:02.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Hatches and turns out to be a bloodthirsty eagle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.11,0:02:04.19,general text,,0,0,0,,not a sophisticated heron
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:05.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:08.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Bloodthirsty eagle, what a horror
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:11.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope the egg is not a woodpecker or a cuckoo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:13.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:16.71,general text,,0,0,0,,The chick will hatch and fly away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:21.38,general text,,0,0,0,,What if she loves him too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:27.34,general text,,0,0,0,,If they are so close, I’m sure the feelings are mutual
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:30.39,general text,,0,0,0,,The chick must be in love with him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:35.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope this is Ms. Ho
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.27,0:02:37.81,general text,,0,0,0,,She looks like Mrs. Do Hwa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:41.98,general text,,0,0,0,,- Eunuch Li\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Put it there. These are Chan Wook's books
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.69,0:02:47.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:53.16,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What connects us with Chan Wook:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.41,0:02:56.54,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,desperate desire to survive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:02.46,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,and find yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.01,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,When we get what we want,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:18.02,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,we will immediately scatter in different directions
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:23.07,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,The love that maid Kim talks about,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.53,0:03:27.74,offscreen,,0,0,0,,maybe she slipped between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.82,0:03:33.49,voiceover,,0,0,0,,but this is nothing more than a shell that I will throw away when I hatch
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:58.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you already learned and written everything down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:02.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, you can check. I'm sure I remembered everything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:06.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:09.24,general text,,0,0,0,,this should have taken at least a month
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:13.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I had 12 teachers, I read these books 12 times
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:14.74,general text,,0,0,0,,One might say,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.20,general text,,0,0,0,,the task was a piece of cake
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:20.71,general text,,0,0,0,,And I was wondering why he agreed to follow the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:22.33,general text,,0,0,0,,He had reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:25.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I can leave Sosnovy Bor whenever I want. I'm home
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:27.50,italics,,0,0,0,,Not so fast
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:37.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:40.27,general text,,0,0,0,,The rules say I can go out if I master the basics
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.35,0:04:42.52,general text,,0,0,0,,When I asked to read books,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:44.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t mean to just remember them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.73,0:04:46.65,general text,,0,0,0,,You should have learned everything by heart
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:49.78,general text,,0,0,0,,But since you are quite cunning,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:53.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t believe that you memorized everything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:56.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:04:59.75,general text,,0,0,0,,that the head of Sosnovy Bor can change the rules as he pleases
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:02.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:04.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I have another task
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:07.50,general text,,0,0,0,,If you read this book,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:12.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I will allow you to leave Sosnovy Bor whenever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:16.97,general text,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:26.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely be able to go out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:29.07,general text,,0,0,0,,if I read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.15,0:05:30.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:33.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope reading this book
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:37.20,general text,,0,0,0,,also not difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:40.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is bad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.41,0:05:42.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Deok won't be able to see Wook for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.39,0:05:58.05,general text,,0,0,0,,What? It's empty here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.47,0:06:04.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all. There are words
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:06.77,general text,,0,0,0,,No, nothing here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:08.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t see anything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.11,0:06:14.65,general text,,0,0,0,,You can read this book only by concentrating your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:17.24,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Master Seo Kyung's book "Words of the Heart"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:21.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:25.71,general text,,0,0,0,,So these are actually words?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:28.50,general text,,0,0,0,,And am I the only one who can’t read them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:35.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Your friend Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:37.43,general text,,0,0,0,,must not have known what kind of book this was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:41.05,general text,,0,0,0,,He never trained. How would he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:43.02,general text,,0,0,0,,He will be locked in the training hall until
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:44.56,general text,,0,0,0,,until he reads it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.27,0:06:46.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for him
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:48.40,general text,,0,0,0,,He was stuck there for six months
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:51.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Six months is not long
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:55.40,general text,,0,0,0,,He mastered Ryusu through luck, not training
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:58.74,general text,,0,0,0,,It will take him more than a year
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:10.46,general text,,0,0,0,,How do we know you if we haven’t seen this book ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:13.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure you would need no less time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:16.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Also, he has advanced further than you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:18.43,general text,,0,0,0,,which, unlike it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:20.64,general text,,0,0,0,,we didn’t hold this book in our hands
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:28.52,general text,,0,0,0,,He's right. Don't talk in vain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:29.69,general text,,0,0,0,,See you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:40.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did his uncle already give him this book?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.70,0:07:42.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m at a loss
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:46.79,general text,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to do anything while he's stuck there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:54.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:57.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m not going to teach Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:01.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I will keep him close and keep an eye on him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:04.55,general text,,0,0,0,,So he won’t cause more problems
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:09.56,general text,,0,0,0,,So you didn’t take him under your wing, but simply locked him in Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:13.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk loudly entered Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.23,0:08:15.86,general text,,0,0,0,,his father will arrive soon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:18.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Father? Chang Gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:21.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Gang’s greatest fear was that Wook would open the gate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:25.33,general text,,0,0,0,,and will be released openly to the world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:27.29,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as Chang Gang finds out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:30.08,general text,,0,0,0,,he will return immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:34.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju must go back and stop Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything will be resolved,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:41.30,general text,,0,0,0,,when he returns
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:45.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.76,general text,,0,0,0,,He's come so far
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.85,0:08:50.10,general text,,0,0,0,,no training at all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:51.56,general text,,0,0,0,,How will he read “Words of the Heart”?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:52.89,general text,,0,0,0,,This is impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.40,0:09:03.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does he also need to carry food?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:06.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard something about him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:09.12,general text,,0,0,0,,There are strange rumors about the family, no skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:11.50,general text,,0,0,0,,- nasty character\N- Not true
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:14.88,general text,,0,0,0,,He's good
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:17.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Where did you get the idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:18.67,general text,,0,0,0,,He is so harmful,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:21.97,general text,,0,0,0,,that the only person who can cope with him is Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:25.76,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mu Dok?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:28.81,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the maid who is always with him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:35.15,memories,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:38.48,memories,,0,0,0,,I heard you were around all night
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.57,0:09:41.69,memories,,0,0,0,,I thought it was Moo Deok. Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:45.95,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why he thought I was Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:53.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:56.79,general text,,0,0,0,,We are from Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:59.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Here, madam
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:39.42,general text,,0,0,0,,This is... fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:06.70,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:08.41,memories,,0,0,0,,I have another task
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:15.08,general text,,0,0,0,,He deceived me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:17.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Wrapped around my finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:36.10,general text,,0,0,0,,It's you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:39.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:42.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, yes. I need to meet someone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.69,0:11:45.57,general text,,0,0,0,,But why through the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:49.20,general text,,0,0,0,,This is an escape
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:53.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Pretend you didn’t see anything
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:12:01.79,italics,,0,0,0,,Miss Huo is so impatient. Why didn't she wait for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:04.21,italics,,0,0,0,,She left without me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:10.22,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.84,0:12:13.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Is Chan Wook not there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.97,0:12:15.56,general text,,0,0,0,,No, he's there
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:17.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go upstairs then
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:21.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:23.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Alone
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:28.78,general text,,0,0,0,,This will take time. Wait outside
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:51.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, the gentleman from Sosnovy Bor has arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Looking for you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:12.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Waiting for Uka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:20.83,general text,,0,0,0,,He won't be around for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.54,general text,,0,0,0,,He was given a very difficult task
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:25.79,general text,,0,0,0,,He can handle it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.67,0:13:28.75,general text,,0,0,0,,The main thing is to stay there
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:31.84,general text,,0,0,0,,and continue learning
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:35.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I've been worried about you since that day, but you look good
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:42.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m a maid here, I worked, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.77,0:13:45.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim is not here now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:47.56,general text,,0,0,0,,You can wait inside
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:49.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to you, not to her
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:52.94,general text,,0,0,0,,To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you need to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:13:58.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.95,0:14:04.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to pick up the umbrella you still have
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:07.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:10.34,general text,,0,0,0,,It was torn due to the wind, I threw it away
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:12.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Then let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:17.55,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:19.22,general text,,0,0,0,,For new
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:21.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Buy me a new umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:27.35,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Umbrellas
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:33.44,general text,,0,0,0,,This one is exactly the same as yours
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:34.90,general text,,0,0,0,,It's cheap...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:39.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Umbrella for one time and cheap paper
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:41.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Mine was made of expensive sheepskin and bamboo
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:44.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:47.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you give the maid an expensive umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:49.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I lent it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:51.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Now it’s time to return it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:56.59,general text,,0,0,0,,This was my only umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:59.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you only have one umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:02.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I rarely walk in the rain
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.22,0:15:07.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I broke my leg as a child,\Nit still hurts when it rains
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:11.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Does your sore leg still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:18.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Park told me how you broke it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.03,0:15:21.87,general text,,0,0,0,,In Danhyangk
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.95,0:15:25.58,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s a pity that you are a magician with a weak leg
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.37,0:15:28.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably healed poorly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:32.50,general text,,0,0,0,,There was a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:35.67,general text,,0,0,0,,which was waiting for me in Danhyangk
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.26,0:15:40.47,general text,,0,0,0,,She saved me and patched up the wound
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:43.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably the leg didn’t heal because
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:47.10,general text,,0,0,0,,that I didn’t thank her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:02.62,general text,,0,0,0,,- I like this one\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:04.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll take this one. Pay
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.91,0:16:08.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:14.50,general text,,0,0,0,,- We'll take this one\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:17.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Write in the name of master Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:20.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Why in his name? You should have paid
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:23.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Where does the maid get the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:24.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You have them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.39,0:16:27.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw. Did you go
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:29.39,general text,,0,0,0,,buy dresses with saved money
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:30.85,general text,,0,0,0,,This is because...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:38.57,general text,,0,0,0,,- How much do I charge?\N- You have good taste
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:41.11,general text,,0,0,0,,This is our most expensive umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:47.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:54.25,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Doc is not there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.42,0:16:58.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did she leave now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:00.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Sir, have you been kicked out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:03.97,general text,,0,0,0,,No. I came for a short while
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.05,0:17:05.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Back soon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:06.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:08.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok will be back soon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.31,0:17:11.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to take a swim first?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:13.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:15.90,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s been a long time since I splashed in the water at home
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:18.15,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’ll prepare everything\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:35.38,general text,,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:38.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Were these honey cookies always so sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:43.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is there no such thing in Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:46.09,general text,,0,0,0,,The head also has a sweet tooth
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:07.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Are we breaking up today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:09.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.12,0:18:13.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Those three talkative sisters will soon be finishing their floriculture lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:14.46,general text,,0,0,0,,and they will pass us by
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:17.33,general text,,0,0,0,,If we argue in front of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:20.04,general text,,0,0,0,,they will start a rumor that we broke up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.93,0:18:27.51,general text,,0,0,0,,As promised,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:30.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be the reason for our separation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:33.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Hit me in the face first
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:35.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Then push away when I try to grab you and leave
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.52,0:18:38.56,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:40.36,general text,,0,0,0,,This is how it should be
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:43.44,general text,,0,0,0,,they believed that we had a quarrel and broke off the engagement
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:47.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Then people will say bad things about you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:50.62,general text,,0,0,0,,And with a bad reputation, it will be difficult to find a suitable bride
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:54.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:57.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want them to look for a partner for me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:02.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I will marry the one,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:05.09,general text,,0,0,0,,what I like
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.85,0:19:15.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I still won’t hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:19.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Better with this pain
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:22.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. It's possible that way
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:27.61,general text,,0,0,0,,The tea is too hot
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:30.91,general text,,0,0,0,,My face will burn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:37.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:39.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:45.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Magic performance coming soon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:48.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to watch
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.47,0:19:52.35,general text,,0,0,0,,But I can’t if we part today
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:55.22,general text,,0,0,0,,But... and... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:59.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I was still at home, and this is almost a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:02.40,general text,,0,0,0,,after the dissolution of the engagement
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:06.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.99,0:20:14.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Then let's postpone the separation for a couple of days?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:15.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:21.29,general text,,0,0,0,,But those three gossips will be there too
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:25.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t think it’s worth going there alone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.55,0:20:30.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Since they already think that we are a couple, I’ll go with you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.51,0:20:34.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, I think we can...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.81,0:20:42.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I want pumpkin and rice toffee,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:44.69,general text,,0,0,0,,and also honey cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:45.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.57,0:20:49.65,general text,,0,0,0,,My master is like a child
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.86,general text,,0,0,0,,He is mischievous when there is nothing to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.78,0:20:53.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.99,0:20:59.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I like these from pine pollen
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:02.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought your preferences were expensive
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:04.46,general text,,0,0,0,,- Give them?\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:17.93,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,We are hiring servants in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:21.35,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,We are hiring servants in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:24.40,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Requirements: healthy, literate, not convicted of crimes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:28.94,general text,,0,0,0,,I chalked it up to the Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:37.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell this to the owner
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:41.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I still have work left. I'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.89,0:21:59.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.01,0:22:01.43,general text,,0,0,0,,- Look around\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.23,0:22:03.35,general text,,0,0,0,,- Sorry\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.43,0:22:04.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:11.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.94,0:22:13.11,general text,,0,0,0,,She
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:16.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:18.37,general text,,0,0,0,,- You stole my money\N- Give back my ring
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.33,0:22:24.87,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mom...\N- Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.96,0:22:27.42,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hey, stop!\N- Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:28.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.75,0:22:31.05,general text,,0,0,0,,- Stop\N- Fraudster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.13,0:22:33.51,general text,,0,0,0,,- Thief!\N- Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.59,0:22:36.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll catch you, you’ll get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.47,0:22:39.51,general text,,0,0,0,,- Stop!\N- Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:43.43,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hurry!\N- What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:44.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Small...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:46.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:48.56,general text,,0,0,0,,- She escaped!\N- That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:50.48,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is that her?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.82,0:22:59.32,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.41,0:23:00.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:07.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Here you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.42,0:23:09.08,general text,,0,0,0,,- Come on...\N- Catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.17,0:23:12.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Come here! I'll arrange this for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:13.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.63,0:23:14.80,italics,,0,0,0,,Oh you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:28.60,general text,,0,0,0,,It was definitely her
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:32.23,general text,,0,0,0,,But why does she see now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.04,0:23:48.21,general text,,0,0,0,,She always blindfolded her eyes with this
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.33,0:23:51.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Wasn’t that her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.77,0:24:13.52,general text,,0,0,0,,We met again,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.36,0:24:15.48,general text,,0,0,0,,So I
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.07,0:24:19.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I came here from the village of Sari because I heard you were here
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.15,0:24:20.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Climbed far
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.41,0:24:23.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you’d hide in the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.41,0:24:26.33,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.70,0:24:31.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Pretended to be blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.58,0:24:36.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Pretended to be a poor thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.09,0:24:39.51,general text,,0,0,0,,and then she stole on the sly
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.97,0:24:43.18,general text,,0,0,0,,How are you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.64,0:24:46.43,general text,,0,0,0,,dare to rob me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:50.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know who...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.98,0:24:53.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.69,0:24:58.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Again you're trying to deceive me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.65,0:24:59.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Grab her
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.07,0:25:05.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.37,0:25:07.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.37,0:25:11.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm blind!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.71,0:25:14.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know them,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.17,0:25:16.54,general text,,0,0,0,,they are trying to kidnap me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.25,0:25:20.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.97,0:25:23.55,general text,,0,0,0,,He’s trying so hard, look
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.47,0:25:27.43,italics,,0,0,0,,Save!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.51,0:25:28.76,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.85,0:25:31.27,general text,,0,0,0,,- Come here\N- Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.94,0:25:44.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Cannot be dragged along against your will
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.61,0:25:48.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I have reasons for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.37,0:25:49.83,general text,,0,0,0,,so out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.54,0:25:52.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm blind,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:54.42,general text,,0,0,0,,- and I don’t know them\N{\i1}- How are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.04,0:25:58.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.35,0:26:12.10,general text,,0,0,0,,He is a magician
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.18,0:26:13.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Run
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.61,0:26:22.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.24,0:26:29.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.87,0:26:31.62,general text,,0,0,0,,They looked dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.70,0:26:33.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Ask the guards for help
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.66,0:26:35.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I will take you to them
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.79,0:26:38.58,general text,,0,0,0,,No need. Everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.29,0:26:41.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Your cane is broken
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.39,0:26:49.35,general text,,0,0,0,,This is an umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.39,0:26:51.68,general text,,0,0,0,,You can take
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.61,0:27:11.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Sir, it’s better to leave her
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.28,0:27:13.83,general text,,0,0,0,,And she didn’t want to go to the guards
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.91,0:27:16.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know anything about her past,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.29,0:27:18.04,general text,,0,0,0,,but these were bandits
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.71,0:27:22.88,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s better not to meddle in their business, you’ll be safe
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.47,0:27:33.64,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I will take you to them
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:36.93,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Ask the guards for help
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.19,0:27:43.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should have agreed
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.13,0:28:06.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Number 125
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.22,0:28:10.72,general text,,0,0,0,,So many people have signed up there already?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.80,0:28:12.14,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,One hundred twenty-five
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.22,0:28:15.06,general text,,0,0,0,,And they will only take five
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.27,0:28:18.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.93,0:28:20.06,italics,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.69,0:28:22.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.98,0:28:24.44,general text,,0,0,0,,The gentleman was looking for you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.52,0:28:26.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Has Mr. Yul come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.07,0:28:29.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Not him, Mr. Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:32.82,general text,,0,0,0,,He ran away and came home
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.08,0:28:45.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to be back before sunset. Where does she wear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.30,0:29:29.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is the master?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.51,0:29:31.67,general text,,0,0,0,,He just left, but I didn’t see him either
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.22,0:29:36.26,general text,,0,0,0,,He said that he would follow the rules, why did he run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.14,0:29:39.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope he doesn’t get caught
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.94,0:29:44.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Just left
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.94,0:29:45.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Just now
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.86,0:29:49.65,general text,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.13,0:30:15.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Uk...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.88,0:30:16.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.56,0:30:24.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Where have you been? I thought we wouldn't see each other
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.38,0:30:55.76,general text,,0,0,0,,But we met. I'm glad
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.34,0:31:00.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to go. If they find out that I left, I'll get screwed
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.72,0:31:04.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait for me. I'll be there soon
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.02,0:31:10.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I found a way, so do what you must
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.31,0:31:12.02,general text,,0,0,0,,And I will do what I must
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.44,0:31:16.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. What kind of method?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.45,0:31:19.37,general text,,0,0,0,,They are recruiting people
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.05,0:31:41.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t get caught. Have a nice trip
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.29,0:32:10.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, why go to Sejukwon yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.58,0:32:12.58,general text,,0,0,0,,You should have called Master Ho to your place
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.09,0:32:17.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop it. It gives me a reason to go out and get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.46,0:32:18.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I like to walk
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.97,0:32:26.06,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.23,0:32:37.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.94,0:32:40.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you are not allowed to leave the training hall
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.11,0:32:41.82,general text,,0,0,0,,until you read “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.91,0:32:44.32,general text,,0,0,0,,First they came to Chwisonru for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.41,0:32:46.08,general text,,0,0,0,,now follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.79,0:32:49.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Where does this interest in me come from? It's scary
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.04,0:32:52.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho told me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.00,0:32:56.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you weren’t able to stand on your feet after the drink I gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.71,0:32:59.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you come to Sejukwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.72,0:33:04.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Do the wounds from my blows still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.30,0:33:05.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Poor...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.47,0:33:08.56,general text,,0,0,0,,They don’t hurt. I'm healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.64,0:33:11.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to take some useful drugs
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.89,0:33:15.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you took a lot of things. You should live a long and healthy life
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.40,0:33:20.11,general text,,0,0,0,,What were you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.20,0:33:22.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Show
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.84,0:33:40.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Honey cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.47,0:33:44.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to eat it myself. How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.72,0:33:45.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Take
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.18,0:33:55.27,general text,,0,0,0,,There are no such sweets in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.73,0:33:57.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.78,0:34:07.91,general text,,0,0,0,,You will have problems if they find out that you ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.53,0:34:11.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You brought me a drink, you gave me a compliment
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.87,0:34:14.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you really tell me about my little offense?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.46,0:34:20.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I... gave you honey cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.22,0:34:30.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Go around that big pine tree. There were many magicians there
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.56,0:34:35.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness. Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.98,0:34:42.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand why I’m so nice to him
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.57,0:34:48.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Tasty
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.91,0:34:50.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.08,0:34:55.87,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is it delicious, Your Highness?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.46,0:34:58.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.29,0:35:02.00,general text,,0,0,0,,will be hostile to magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.17,0:35:05.09,general text,,0,0,0,,And he sheathed the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.76,0:35:07.93,general text,,0,0,0,,and became closer to them
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.55,0:35:11.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he decided to make them his friends in order to use,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.89,0:35:13.52,general text,,0,0,0,,when will he become the next king
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.23,0:35:18.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you shouldn’t do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.69,0:35:19.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.02,0:35:21.98,general text,,0,0,0,,It won’t be difficult to change his opinion
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.61,0:35:24.94,general text,,0,0,0,,We have a sign with the constellation of Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.74,0:35:30.20,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince will have no choice but to kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.17,0:35:45.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Are we using this to subjugate Jin Ho Kyung?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.84,0:35:49.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Jinyeowon will soon be ours
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.82,0:36:12.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Four hours have passed since the lady came in
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.12,0:36:16.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.45,0:36:17.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently they had a lot to discuss
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.50,0:36:24.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.30,0:36:27.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I asked you not to disturb them!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.63,0:36:28.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Something is wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.88,0:36:31.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to check if Chan Wook is there or not
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.18,0:36:33.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think my lady is lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.98,0:36:41.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Why hasn’t he returned yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.73,0:36:46.15,general text,,0,0,0,,It will be strange if they find out that he is not here
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.28,0:36:58.16,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.12,0:37:03.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I said that we will be together so that you don’t get caught
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.33,0:37:06.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for your return
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.76,0:37:15.76,general text,,0,0,0,,See? They are together
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.81,0:37:19.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.64,0:37:22.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Nice talking to you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.10,0:37:25.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, mutual
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.90,0:37:27.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.70,0:37:39.95,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you do during these four hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.37,0:37:42.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.37,0:37:46.79,general text,,0,0,0,,What were we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.27,0:38:10.73,general text,,0,0,0,,She was bored
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.16,0:38:17.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to become a maid in Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.20,0:38:20.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. You know what happened today
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.33,0:38:24.62,general text,,0,0,0,,The owner needs me nearby
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.46,0:38:26.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I agree
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.17,0:38:30.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he was very uncomfortable there that he came home to wash and eat
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.63,0:38:34.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Our master is very gentle. Everyone was running around him when he was growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.01,0:38:37.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Life with others in Sosnovy Bor is not suitable for him
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.80,0:38:39.05,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,One hundred twenty-five
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.14,0:38:40.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I have already signed up
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.26,0:38:42.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely get there
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.39,0:38:45.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, but this is not necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.98,0:38:47.48,general text,,0,0,0,,We are servants of the Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.56,0:38:49.02,general text,,0,0,0,,We can easily get there
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.65,0:38:50.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.65,0:38:53.65,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t need to take the exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.74,0:38:56.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course. Trust me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.49,0:39:00.95,general text,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.62,0:39:05.46,italics,,0,0,0,,Servants in Sosnovy Bor are hired only through open selection
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.54,0:39:06.79,italics,,0,0,0,,No exceptions
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.87,0:39:09.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m not asking to give her a place for nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.13,0:39:11.88,general text,,0,0,0,,She only needs an amulet. Write her name
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.96,0:39:13.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Then she will get it
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.63,0:39:15.38,general text,,0,0,0,,We will pay every month
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.93,0:39:20.18,general text,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.85,0:39:21.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.35,0:39:26.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought it would suit you, so I took it with me, maid Pak
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.59,0:40:01.47,general text,,0,0,0,,They say you tried
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.55,0:40:05.43,general text,,0,0,0,,bribe the maid Pak with this
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.06,0:40:09.14,general text,,0,0,0,,- It’s just a gift...\N- You asked her
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.06,0:40:12.40,general text,,0,0,0,,give Moo Deok a place here
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.48,0:40:15.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Our gentleman is very sensitive,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.61,0:40:17.57,general text,,0,0,0,,so I thought if Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.65,0:40:21.62,general text,,0,0,0,,it will be easier with him, it will be easier for the gentleman, so I asked for a favor
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.16,0:40:24.37,general text,,0,0,0,,So this is bribery indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.74,0:40:29.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I didn't think
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.12,0:40:31.17,general text,,0,0,0,,When the maid Pak brought this to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.25,0:40:34.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I told her that you would never do that
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.88,0:40:36.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I was sure
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.09,0:40:40.09,general text,,0,0,0,,How can I look her in the eyes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.18,0:40:41.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.72,0:40:48.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I will apologize to her
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.81,0:40:50.02,general text,,0,0,0,,What will people think?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.85,0:40:54.31,general text,,0,0,0,,They will think that you took advantage of our relationship,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.40,0:40:56.27,general text,,0,0,0,,to give someone a bribe
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.36,0:40:59.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I gave her a scarf, but I didn’t mention you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.90,0:41:01.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.15,0:41:03.78,general text,,0,0,0,,everyone in Sosnovy Bor knows that we are close
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.87,0:41:07.54,general text,,0,0,0,,If you do this, I won’t be able to anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.91,0:41:14.96,general text,,0,0,0,,maintain our close relationships
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.80,0:41:20.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Then... I won't come here anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.68,0:41:22.88,general text,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.97,0:41:26.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Were you and I so close?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.22,0:41:29.02,general text,,0,0,0,,If it were like that, you wouldn’t be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.10,0:41:32.14,general text,,0,0,0,,it’s so easy to talk about breaking up a relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.23,0:41:33.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.27,0:41:37.61,general text,,0,0,0,,- Maid Kim, I...\N- I'll tell Maid Park,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.69,0:41:40.11,general text,,0,0,0,,that I, who dared to give a bribe,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.19,0:41:41.61,general text,,0,0,0,,absolutely
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.70,0:41:44.82,general text,,0,0,0,,not close with the head of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.91,0:41:46.20,general text,,0,0,0,,- This is...\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.78,0:41:48.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m very sorry that because of me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.87,0:41:50.25,general text,,0,0,0,,you lost face
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.12,0:41:52.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.37,0:41:56.29,general text,,0,0,0,,You can't just leave
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.17,0:42:04.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Take this
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.34,0:42:09.85,general text,,0,0,0,,If I keep it, it will mean that I accepted a bribe
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.82,0:42:28.53,general text,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.78,0:42:31.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.46,0:42:36.62,general text,,0,0,0,,that I don’t want to see you...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.71,0:42:37.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Service...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.88,0:42:39.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.88,0:42:46.09,general text,,0,0,0,,How complicated everything is
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.99,0:43:05.49,italics,,0,0,0,,You won’t read
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.24,0:43:09.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.03,0:43:12.95,general text,,0,0,0,,With your current concentration, you will not be able to read
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.62,0:43:16.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You never trained hard, unlike the others
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.87,0:43:19.88,general text,,0,0,0,,How long will it take if I start training now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.96,0:43:22.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Fastest - year
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.42,0:43:26.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Not suitable. I refuse to sit here for a whole year
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.72,0:43:29.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I think that's why Park Jin gave you this book
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.39,0:43:35.85,general text,,0,0,0,,You will reduce the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.60,0:43:40.36,general text,,0,0,0,,if you become my student and follow my teachings
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.44,0:43:41.61,general text,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.98,0:43:44.69,general text,,0,0,0,,drink that tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.95,0:43:50.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Give me time to think
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.70,0:43:54.12,general text,,0,0,0,,This is my teacher's book
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.20,0:43:58.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Here is a poem by master Seo Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.62,0:43:59.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Verse?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.87,0:44:01.88,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not that long
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.88,0:44:05.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Read the first word,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.55,0:44:07.51,general text,,0,0,0,,the rest will follow by itself
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.97,0:44:11.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. You can't read it yet
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.68,0:44:15.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Is it fun to mock me? You won't tell me what's there
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.81,0:44:17.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Fun to watch
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.10,0:44:21.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Help you this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.48,0:44:24.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.23,0:44:28.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll tell you an unknown secret
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.90,0:44:33.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Actually this is a love letter
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.08,0:44:36.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Love letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.54,0:44:37.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.66,0:44:41.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Hundreds of magicians have read this book, but no one knows it
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.50,0:44:49.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Master So Kyung wrote this book to the one who could not see,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.63,0:44:52.47,general text,,0,0,0,,so that she reads it with her heart
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.10,0:45:00.31,general text,,0,0,0,,The book can be read by concentrating energy
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.39,0:45:04.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Think about how else this is possible, knowing that this is a love letter
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.98,0:45:09.69,general text,,0,0,0,,How does a love letter begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.95,0:45:18.12,general text,,0,0,0,,What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.12,0:45:22.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he a pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.46,0:45:26.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Why let someone read your love letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.54,0:45:29.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should I read this? I still don't see anything
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.09,0:45:31.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Was he really a pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.59,0:45:39.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, it’s already getting colder. Why do you need to return to Danhyangok?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.10,0:45:42.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay here. I'll take care of you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.98,0:45:44.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Yom
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.10,0:45:48.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Warm clothes and comfortable housing will not help you train
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.90,0:45:53.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I just want my teacher to live warm
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.66,0:45:59.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you grown up?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.60,0:46:20.14,general text,,0,0,0,,This is maid Kim from the Chan house
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.72,0:46:23.73,general text,,0,0,0,,She looks sad, apparently she had a fight with Jin again
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.23,0:46:27.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, masters!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.65,0:46:32.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.74,0:46:36.16,general text,,0,0,0,,why did you leave so hastily that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.24,0:46:37.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I couldn’t thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.03,0:46:41.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.87,0:46:44.58,general text,,0,0,0,,At the holiday in Chwisongru
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.67,0:46:47.17,general text,,0,0,0,,How are your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.25,0:46:49.46,general text,,0,0,0,,She broke up
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.75,0:46:51.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.46,0:46:53.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Dissolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.80,0:46:55.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.68,0:46:56.80,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s cold
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.88,0:46:58.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you freezing in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.26,0:47:02.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Take a scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.14,0:47:04.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.60,0:47:10.69,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a gift, not a bribe
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.27,0:47:12.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.84,0:47:33.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Suits you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.72,0:47:46.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you comfortable in a scarf?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.11,0:47:59.28,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Competition for selecting servants in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.45,0:48:03.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.24,0:48:06.75,general text,,0,0,0,,we will begin the selection of servants
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.83,0:48:10.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Those who pass will end up in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.33,0:48:13.59,italics,,0,0,0,,I'll go through the list
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.30,0:48:16.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Answer when I call your name
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.43,0:48:21.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Number 1: Park Joon Hwa
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.10,0:48:22.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.05,0:48:24.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Number two: Ahn So-jeong
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.06,0:48:26.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.93,0:48:29.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Ahn So Jeong...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.10,0:48:30.35,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Two
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.44,0:48:31.44,general text,,0,0,0,,An...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.11,0:48:35.44,general text,,0,0,0,,- Three: Lee Young Ok\N{\i1}- Here
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.53,0:48:37.40,general text,,0,0,0,,- Four: Park Hyun Soo\N{\i1}- Here
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.40,0:48:40.70,general text,,0,0,0,,- Five: Bae Hwi Young\N-{\i1} Here
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.08,0:48:49.16,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.25,0:48:50.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.54,0:48:56.88,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,125: Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.63,0:48:59.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Here she comes
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.97,0:49:02.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Number 125: Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.26,0:49:05.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.48,0:49:14.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Your maid, Mu Dok, is in Sosnovy Bor today
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.61,0:49:17.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.44,0:49:18.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about leaving this room
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.03,0:49:20.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you do it with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.28,0:49:24.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you not make noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.91,0:49:27.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to concentrate to read
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.45,0:49:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.38,0:49:46.14,general text,,0,0,0,,In three days I am waiting for you, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.22,0:49:50.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is Sosnovy Bor so crowded today?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.89,0:49:55.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Today they are holding a competition to hire new servants
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.81,0:49:58.61,general text,,0,0,0,,- Is it necessary to organize a whole competition?\N- Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.19,0:50:01.49,general text,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of people who want to work here
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.57,0:50:04.70,general text,,0,0,0,,The Chan family maid was also here
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.07,0:50:08.16,general text,,0,0,0,,- Won Mu Deok?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.46,0:50:23.09,general text,,0,0,0,,The first task will be appreciated
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.67,0:50:28.22,general text,,0,0,0,,your ability to read and count
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.01,0:50:30.72,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to solve everything correctly
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.81,0:50:33.48,general text,,0,0,0,,One wrong answer and you are immediately eliminated
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.73,0:50:43.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.07,0:50:47.41,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a task from a competition
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.33,0:50:51.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Lots of questions. Even with a short answer
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.45,0:50:53.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok is smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.04,0:50:55.54,general text,,0,0,0,,she can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.75,0:51:00.13,general text,,0,0,0,,It's complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.21,0:51:03.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Oh, how can you remove ink from clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.09,0:51:04.22,italics,,0,0,0,,Here is a question
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.30,0:51:06.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Rice paste is just right
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.30,0:51:08.55,italics,,0,0,0,,And what should you do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.64,0:51:11.47,general text,,0,0,0,,First you need a little on the stain...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.69,0:51:20.69,general text,,0,0,0,,"You invited 20 people from 3 different families"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.77,0:51:24.15,general text,,0,0,0,,"Four people can sit at one table, how many tables do you need?"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.11,0:51:29.57,general text,,0,0,0,,20 from each family - that’s 60 in total
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.66,0:51:35.29,general text,,0,0,0,,There are four people at one table,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.16,0:51:37.42,general text,,0,0,0,,- need 15\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.33,0:51:40.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Three families are specifically mentioned
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.29,0:51:45.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Representatives of the same family should sit at the same table
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.05,0:51:48.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we need more tables
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.47,0:51:50.76,general text,,0,0,0,,There are 9 tables for each family
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.22,0:51:53.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Then there are 27 tables in total
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.02,0:52:01.48,general text,,0,0,0,,This is an invitation
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.56,0:52:03.11,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,9 x 3 = 27
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.19,0:52:05.86,general text,,0,0,0,,The host will also need a table
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.61,0:52:08.15,labels,,0,0,0,,27 + host = 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.24,0:52:09.74,general text,,0,0,0,,28 total
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.16,0:52:14.33,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.95,0:52:16.95,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,28
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.46,0:52:20.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Next is the question of how to complete the assignment and not get lost
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.00,0:52:23.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll get a map of the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.63,0:52:26.80,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,How can you remove ink from clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.47,0:52:29.76,general text,,0,0,0,,What to do if ink is spilled on your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.84,0:52:32.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Can’t be thrown away? Eunuch O
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.39,0:52:34.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.72,0:52:37.73,general text,,0,0,0,,How to remove ink from clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.81,0:52:39.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Take some warm rice paste
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.98,0:52:41.85,general text,,0,0,0,,- and smear...\N- Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.98,0:52:44.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Write
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.98,0:52:46.82,general text,,0,0,0,,"Warm rice paste"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.57,0:52:53.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything is exactly right
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.37,0:52:55.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t think that I would do something like this with you, but it was fun
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.12,0:52:58.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok herself can’t handle it
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.58,0:53:07.25,general text,,0,0,0,,So we need to somehow give her this paper
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.76,0:53:12.26,general text,,0,0,0,,And how? It will be too obvious
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.26,0:53:17.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps someone very noticeable will avoid suspicion
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.45,0:53:38.66,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.29,0:53:41.04,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,More difficult than I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.08,0:53:45.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t peep!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.25,0:53:51.67,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince has arrived! Say hello to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.09,0:53:56.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.68,0:53:59.72,general text,,0,0,0,,- Your Highness!\N- Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.77,0:54:09.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard there is an important competition here, so I came to support you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.15,0:54:12.70,general text,,0,0,0,,It is an honor for us
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.78,0:54:15.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t pay attention to me, do the task
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.88,0:54:34.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Working!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.26,0:54:37.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.18,0:54:39.39,italics,,0,0,0,,Decide
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.47,0:54:40.81,general text,,0,0,0,,- You too\N- Decided...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.35,0:54:42.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Get back to work
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.43,0:55:28.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I will announce those who passed
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.36,0:55:34.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Park Jung Hwa. Passed
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.03,0:55:37.32,italics,,0,0,0,,Lee Young Ok failed
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.40,0:55:40.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Hwang Young Ji failed
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.33,0:55:43.37,italics,,0,0,0,,Oh Jae Ho passed
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.87,0:55:47.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Number 125
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.62,0:55:48.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.93,0:56:00.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.68,0:56:04.14,general text,,0,0,0,,She passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.22,0:56:05.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.02,0:56:11.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Excellent
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.06,0:56:16.19,italics,,0,0,0,,40 people completed the first task
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.28,0:56:19.82,general text,,0,0,0,,And then a practical task
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.32,0:56:26.70,italics,,0,0,0,,This task will evaluate their skills
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.58,0:56:28.91,italics,,0,0,0,,Cook food,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.00,0:56:31.83,general text,,0,0,0,,clean up, wash things
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.92,0:56:34.38,general text,,0,0,0,,And then they will also test your endurance
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.70,0:57:06.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Number 125, Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.41,0:57:07.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.86,0:57:38.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Number 125, Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.03,0:57:39.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.99,0:57:44.16,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,One hundred twenty-five
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.88,0:57:56.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Number 125, Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.34,0:57:58.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.97,0:58:04.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok is amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.59,0:58:06.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Last task left
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.47,0:58:08.39,general text,,0,0,0,,We must go and support her
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.14,0:58:12.06,general text,,0,0,0,,There were a lot of good guys there
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.14,0:58:14.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I doubt that she will be among those who passed
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.48,0:58:16.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, thank you for your help
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.31,0:58:18.27,general text,,0,0,0,,For this
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.57,0:58:22.70,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let's go\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.24,0:58:29.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that what he told me not to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.24,0:58:31.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Why be so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.75,0:58:33.87,italics,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.79,0:58:36.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t matter. Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.17,0:58:38.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, we should go there
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.46,0:58:43.47,general text,,0,0,0,,- I know\N- Yes, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.47,0:58:48.89,general text,,0,0,0,,We must walk five ri and return with water*
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.47,0:58:48.89,notes,,0,0,0,,*about 20 km
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.97,0:58:50.43,general text,,0,0,0,,The first five
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.10,0:58:54.39,general text,,0,0,0,,will win the competition
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.64,0:58:56.90,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,The last obstacle
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.11,0:59:00.11,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I should be among the first
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.29,0:59:13.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.71,0:59:24.84,general text,,0,0,0,,He stares at “Words of the Heart” for days
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.59,0:59:27.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.98,0:59:37.98,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t read it that quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.06,0:59:39.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Be patient
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.73,0:59:43.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.73,0:59:47.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim is very worried about you
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.91,0:59:49.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me know if you need anything
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.78,0:59:53.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I will order the bed, food and clothes you want to be prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.79,0:59:57.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Not worth it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.38,1:00:08.72,general text,,0,0,0,,The wind is colder
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.80,1:00:11.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Close windows
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.76,1:00:16.93,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Master So Kyung wrote this book to the one who could not see,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.02,1:00:19.98,memories,,0,0,0,,so she can read it with her heart
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.61,1:00:23.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I have a question
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.32,1:00:28.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Master So Kyung knew a blind woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.07,1:00:34.45,general text,,0,0,0,,During the great chaos of two hundred years ago
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.12,1:00:37.37,general text,,0,0,0,,there was a
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.45,1:00:39.83,general text,,0,0,0,,first chapter of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.92,1:00:42.88,general text,,0,0,0,,And she was blind
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.09,1:00:47.84,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,He wrote this message to the head of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.72,1:00:53.80,general text,,0,0,0,,And this can definitely be read by everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.47,1:00:56.60,general text,,0,0,0,,And if his feelings are described here,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.68,1:00:58.77,general text,,0,0,0,,which you put on public display?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.81,1:01:05.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Trying to use me to read a book
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.48,1:01:08.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll say this
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.36,1:01:13.41,general text,,0,0,0,,This book has nothing to do with the feelings of the master
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.66,1:01:20.21,memories,,0,0,0,,Hundreds of magicians have read this book, but no one knows it
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.79,1:01:23.63,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Nobody knows this is a love letter
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.71,1:01:25.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Instead of being cunning,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.75,1:01:28.21,general text,,0,0,0,,do training
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.01,1:01:32.22,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,How could no one understand this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.14,1:01:40.48,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,The book can be read by concentrating energy
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.56,1:01:45.15,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Think how else this is possible, knowing that this is a love letter
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.98,1:01:49.65,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,So there must be some other way
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.69,1:01:52.86,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,The rest don’t know this
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.95,1:01:55.45,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,This is known only to those who know about the love letter
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.03,1:01:57.41,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.49,1:02:00.66,memories,,0,0,0,,How does a love letter begin?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.72,1:02:13.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Another question
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.09,1:02:15.76,general text,,0,0,0,,What was your name
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.76,1:02:18.31,general text,,0,0,0,,the first chapter of Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.61,1:02:32.53,general text,,0,0,0,,All love letters
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.99,1:02:35.86,general text,,0,0,0,,begin with the recipient's name
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.78,1:02:37.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Her last name
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.49,1:02:41.66,general text,,0,0,0,,was Jin, and the name was Seol Ran
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.66,1:02:45.00,general text,,0,0,0,,The recipient of the letter was Sol Ran
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.08,1:02:46.71,general text,,0,0,0,,"Orchid flower,"
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.88,1:02:49.17,general text,,0,0,0,,"that is covered in snow"
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.75,1:02:51.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Her name
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.17,1:02:55.05,general text,,0,0,0,,will open this letter
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.55,1:03:34.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.93,1:03:44.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, here she is
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.94,1:03:48.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Here is Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.12,1:04:04.66,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"Do not curb the flow of water"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.16,1:04:07.71,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"But every year the earth blooms"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.50,1:04:11.54,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"We will not take fire into our hands"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.63,1:04:13.05,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"Let's light a fire with wood"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.38,1:04:17.26,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"And the wind blows too"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.88,1:04:20.34,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"a rock or a stone will stop"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.05,1:04:25.81,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"If you give them free rein, they will disperse to their heart's content"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.60,1:04:29.02,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"I see the blue firmament"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.69,1:04:32.02,offscreen,,0,0,0,,"A quiet sigh is heard"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.86,1:04:37.03,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"I breathe cold and fade away"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.61,1:04:39.82,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"I turn my sighs into snow and tears"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.95,1:04:43.74,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"But I can’t shed tears. I hide them as best I can"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.33,1:04:48.08,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"I know my eyes will fill with tears again"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.79,1:04:53.13,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"But I'm a fool, not a single tear rolled down my cheek"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.42,1:05:00.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Those two have already returned
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.68,1:05:03.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t see Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.48,1:05:14.56,general text,,0,0,0,,There are already six people in front of her
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.65,1:05:16.86,general text,,0,0,0,,We must overtake at least two
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.33,1:05:30.41,captions,,0,0,0,,"But I'm a fool, not a single tear rolled down my cheek"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.56,1:05:47.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.68,1:05:49.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.31,1:05:53.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I read
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.83,1:06:16.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Number 29,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.92,1:06:18.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Jang Jong Do, you passed
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.80,1:06:22.01,general text,,0,0,0,,One more person left
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.00,1:06:57.08,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I don’t need a student who doesn’t make progress
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.58,1:06:59.67,memories,,0,0,0,,If you don’t do anything, just die
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.71,1:07:02.71,memories,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.80,1:07:04.51,memories,,0,0,0,,You are no longer Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.18,1:07:13.14,voiceover,,0,0,0,,"It doesn't matter how bad you feel,"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.23,1:07:16.31,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,"you have to do what you can"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.77,1:07:20.65,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,If I don’t want to do anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.23,1:07:23.69,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.17,1:07:45.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Number 125, Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.47,1:07:48.80,general text,,0,0,0,,you passed!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.02,1:08:00.81,general text,,0,0,0,,This is word for word “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.52,1:08:03.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook did it
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.86,1:08:07.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Did he cope?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.16,1:08:15.33,general text,,0,0,0,,- Where is he now?\N- In Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.41,1:08:18.71,general text,,0,0,0,,His maid fainted during the competition,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.79,1:08:20.00,general text,,0,0,0,,he took her there
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.17,1:08:22.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.00,1:08:24.96,general text,,0,0,0,,- Are you talking about Mu Dok?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.05,1:08:27.01,general text,,0,0,0,,She passed the competition
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.72,1:08:29.93,general text,,0,0,0,,She fell at the very end,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.01,1:08:32.05,general text,,0,0,0,,but she succeeded
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.76,1:08:34.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.31,1:08:41.65,memories italics,,0,0,0,,My maid risked her life to fulfill my request
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.36,1:08:43.73,memories italics,,0,0,0,,It was my idea
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.75,1:08:58.08,general text,,0,0,0,,If you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.83,1:09:02.00,general text,,0,0,0,,she is always next to Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.04,1:09:05.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.55,1:09:15.35,general text,,0,0,0,,The book I read was a love letter from Master Seo Kyung
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.14,1:09:19.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.14,1:09:22.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did he make her invisible?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.98,1:09:26.57,general text,,0,0,0,,His beloved was blind, he wanted her to read her with her heart
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.94,1:09:29.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Smart
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.99,1:09:31.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t think so,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.95,1:09:33.70,general text,,0,0,0,,that the letter has reached the addressee
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.45,1:09:36.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Then it would be in Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.29,1:09:38.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Not in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.45,1:09:42.62,general text,,0,0,0,,An invisible love letter that was never sent?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.75,1:09:45.84,general text,,0,0,0,,How cowardly
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.80,1:09:50.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Write down feelings and didn’t let her know
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.63,1:09:53.01,general text,,0,0,0,,How stupid
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.34,1:09:55.89,general text,,0,0,0,,and a pathetic love letter
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.52,1:10:03.44,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right. He should have...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.52,1:10:08.36,general text,,0,0,0,,send a letter as you did
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.82,1:10:12.45,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,We are hiring servants in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.82,1:10:15.28,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not a letter
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.37,1:10:16.74,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this then?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.83,1:10:19.54,general text,,0,0,0,,If it conveys your feelings, this is a letter
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.08,1:10:23.58,memories,,0,0,0,,Wait for me. I'll be there soon
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.67,1:10:25.42,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t get caught. Have a nice trip
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.80,1:10:38.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I probably looked pathetic in my attempts to get here as a servant
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.97,1:10:42.60,general text,,0,0,0,,You were an incredibly experienced teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.10,1:10:44.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.85,1:10:48.36,general text,,0,0,0,,At least you learned loyalty\N and fulfill your duties
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.44,1:10:50.48,general text,,0,0,0,,My teacher tried so hard for me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.57,1:10:53.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought I should give it my all
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.24,1:10:57.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Did this stress you out?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.74,1:11:01.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Not really. But I doubted
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.33,1:11:07.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Answer you as a student or as a master
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.67,1:11:10.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Or answer in the style of what you read
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.26,1:11:17.80,general text,,0,0,0,,And what did you read?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.72,1:11:22.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Then answer the same?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.06,1:11:25.60,general text,,0,0,0,,The same? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.14,1:11:30.27,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s written right there. "I'll go through anything just to see you"
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.98,1:11:34.28,general text,,0,0,0,,"I can do anything, just to have the opportunity to see you"
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.90,1:11:36.28,general text,,0,0,0,,And this is my answer
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.41,1:11:45.87,voiceover,,0,0,0,,We should have been prepared before letting him get so close
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.00,1:11:51.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I missed you too
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.42,1:11:56.76,general text,,0,0,0,,This is my answer
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.93,1:12:07.73,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What I gave him,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.27,1:12:13.27,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,not worth reading or transmitting at all
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.15,1:12:16.78,offscreen,,0,0,0,,That was my stupid and pathetic
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.57,1:12:20.16,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,love letter
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.00,1:12:53.19,preview,,0,0,0,,Open my eyes - I already miss you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.27,1:12:55.19,preview,,0,0,0,,- I miss you all day\N- Enough
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.28,1:12:57.36,preview,,0,0,0,,There is no escape from this poison
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.44,1:12:59.40,preview,,0,0,0,,The antidote is the man who poisoned you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.49,1:13:00.86,preview,,0,0,0,,Are you completely crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.95,1:13:02.82,preview,,0,0,0,,These are the symptoms of my poisoning
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.91,1:13:06.04,preview,,0,0,0,,Nak Su, there is only one person in your thoughts. And this is Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.12,1:13:08.25,preview,,0,0,0,,You didn’t believe it when I said I was in love with you
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.33,1:13:10.29,preview,,0,0,0,,Then make me believe
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.37,1:13:12.83,preview,,0,0,0,,This is the most valuable thing I have received
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.92,1:13:15.84,preview,,0,0,0,,Do everything you can to get him back
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.92,1:13:18.72,preview,,0,0,0,,I had an argument with your maid
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.80,1:13:21.01,preview,,0,0,0,,Fight and die, Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.09,1:13:22.18,preview,,0,0,0,,I said I missed you,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.26,1:13:23.68,preview,,0,0,0,,and you said that this is my weakness
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.76,1:13:25.10,preview,,0,0,0,,Don’t go
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.76,1:13:29.39,preview,,0,0,0,,I really like Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,

